 "kind": "resistor",
 "manufacturer": "YAGEO",
 "title": "RT series high-precision thin-film chip resistors, 0100 to 2512, ±0.01% to ±1%, 5 to 50 ppm/°C",
 "source": {
  "document": "RT series product specification",
  "revision": "V.17, February 12, 2026",
  "pages": 10
 },
 "summary": "Surface-mount thin-film chip resistors in nine sizes, RT0100 (0.40 × 0.20 mm) to RT2512 (6.35 × 3.20 mm), with tolerances from ±0.01% to ±1% and temperature coefficients from ±5 to ±50 ppm/°C. Rated power at 70 °C runs from 1/32 W (RT0100) to 1 W (RT2512 high-power grade), with maximum working voltages from 15 V to 200 V. Terminations are lead free (nickel under matte tin); the parts are RoHS compliant and halogen free, MSL 1, and are aimed at converters, printing equipment, server boards, telecom and consumer products. Phycomp-brand parts may also be ordered by a 12NC code.",
